ar Iris’s equipment debt in exchange for advance sight of articles. The proposal remains unanswered in her private correspondence.","category":"local_knowledge","truth_mode":"secret","knowledge_scope":"private","content_level":"standard","location_id":"b8e6063d-69c1-5791-bb0d-595e8ea26148","district_location_id":"8ea973d5-94fe-5c5c-8cb3-84a90abef76e","topic_tags":["keenes-print-shop","place_private"],"trigger_terms":["Keene’s Print Shop"],"active":true,"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringFactId":"dca265e6-f54c-5c9b-9374-1200b506d2e9","requiresSavedDisclosure":true,"characterSlugs":["iris-keene"],"revealGate":"Explicit voluntary disclosure or an authored evidence transition; ownership alone does not reveal another person’s knowledge.","partialKnowledge":[]}},{"id":"662b8362-a947-54bd-8c35-b52958ee6b00","world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","slug":"calders-662b8362-a947-54bd-8c35-b52958ee6b00","title":"County Courthouse: place","fact_text":"The county’s modest record office and hearing rooms, where property, inheritance, and public promises acquire forms that outlast the people arguing over them.","category":"local_knowledge","truth_mode":"canonical","knowledge_scope":"local","content_level":"standard","location_id":"12a6914f-0fe4-544d-bfe9-b36c97ea81e8","district_location_id":"8ea973d5-94fe-5c5c-8cb3-84a90abef76e","topic_tags":["county-courthouse","place"],"trigger_terms":["County Courthouse"],"active":true,"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringFactId":"662b8362-a947-54bd-8c35-b52958ee6b00","requiresSavedDisclosure":false,"characterSlugs":["esther-wynn"],"revealGate":null,"partialKnowledge":[]}},{"id":"68999dd9-929f-53e5-a6fd-9089dc277b7f","world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","slug":"calders-68999dd9-929f-53e5-a6fd-9089dc277b7f","title":"County Courthouse: place_private","fact_text":"A copied water-register page combines measurements from different years. Its existence is genuine; whether its use was 