s to investors.","fracture":"Workers and engineers can support construction while opposing land speculation or labor practices.","privatePressure":"The investors want dependable earnings before authorizing the expensive alternative approach.","offer":"Employment, introductions, transport, supplies, and a credible future for east-bank businesses.","cost":"Dependence on a company able to change rates, terminate contracts, or bypass local suppliers.","id":"3a397716-8765-59da-ae22-71edbf92f159","seatLocationId":"ec896c98-a5c1-5cdc-b6e9-96cdefc12925","associatedCharacterIds":["27a5c487-a218-52b9-8798-2906889b7faa","dbc7cf13-72ae-587a-b3d1-468ca2f132b1","39ed7112-d367-5790-a841-f76c9eab8052","dcd714c0-b3e9-5baf-9741-576729534661","e35b15cf-fcb2-5955-829c-3cb37661c7ac","77ae229b-0456-55e9-bf5a-6358ef347bcc"]},{"slug":"valley-water-association","name":"Valley Water Association","publicAim":"Keep water usable and local agriculture viable.","resources":"Turn registers, headworks crews, cultivated land, livestock, and council influence.","fracture":"Established holdings receive advantages that smaller growers want revised.","privatePressure":"A bad season will expose members who promised more water than they can deliver.","offer":"Local knowledge, work, household introductions, and support for independent ventures.","cost":"Pressure to defend neighbors even when their claims are unfair.","id":"d245ab9d-7776-5bef-aab2-f7ad87a8dd78","seatLocationId":"aac1591a-0117-5969-b59e-1f2d6b1b1ab1","associatedCharacterIds":["8d8a8b9e-aac5-5c86-883c-e55d5c1245ba","43961d6e-533a-5c23-8471-fae9af0d437e","1da23f8d-f6c7-5bf5-8da7-e40715399063","96098866-3090-5564-9617-ac35b34cbd35","788149f7-b7e6-5b4b-9fac-4d04eb4b7b05","fe0749b0-c5c5-5fb0-825c-5faae2bb1360","cffa45a6-3817-5f0d-9fde-3ec4ca76696a"]},{"slug":"miners-mutual","name":"Saint Agnes Mutual Society","publicAim":"Honest weighing, timely wages, practical safety, and relief for affected households.","resources":"Dues, work records, collective labor, supply relationships, and neighborhood trust.","fracture":"Some members favor accommodation to preserve jobs; others believe delay costs lives.","privatePressure":"The relief fund cannot absorb another long interruption of wages.","offer":"Solidarity, useful work, testimony, and access to a community that notices who helps.","cost":"Public association can strain business ties and expose internal disagreements.","id":"c59447e1-7cd4-5087-82fd-9ad5f95e65d4","seatLocationId":"b293826d-7379-5ead-9e36-d0925ae2acb7","associatedCharacterIds":["c48b4d60-f01d-50e5-8a74-f5c7977df0b5","2a838e0f-f2e8-582a-8925-1380e8f9cc3b","cc342d4a-c160-5567-87aa-07506734b1f9","82e1ec55-9183-5279-a7f8-1e62d54061b1","b118391c-c144-5e58-9bda-6ccc7a100d38","b884dee9-b258-5d00-97cd-16a401685fa6","de185ba5-cd6b-5022-80cd-8669cc8cfaf2"]},{"slug":"town-compact","name":"Town Compact and Civic Offices","publicAim":"Keep the settlement governable and preserve public services.","resources":"Records, public hearings, notices, licenses, relief work, and limited law enforcement.","fracture":"Order, fairness, prosperity, and institutional survival point toward different choices.","privatePressure":"Several officials rely on informal exceptions they would struggle to defend publicly.","offer":"Legitimate procedures, introductions, protection of records, and public recognition.","cost":"Working through institutions means delay, compromise, and accountability.","id":"ca9cd900-d6bc-54e1-b997-cc864ae15953","seatLocationId":"12a6914f-0fe4-544d-bfe9-b36c97ea81e8","associatedCharacterIds":["63a4bf14-598c-509f-861f-46a1ce3c729b","8d8a8b9e-aac5-5c86-883c-e55d5c1245ba","65bf20fb-85f1-51f2-8b4a-cfe7cee517ef","0545674e-2ac8-540c-a0b2-ac6882fc4641","17799880-e679-5080-b921-b9f4afa3b6fb","fa092c09-c4c0-5ca4-8482-1c00cc7e5897","dc689ec4-8705-5bcc-80f2-00d8c2180e6a","be0f7849-8182-5ee7-bb81-03aa9c1ec5e9"]},{"slug":"lantern-business-circle","name":"Lantern Business Circle","publicAim":"Keep the evening economy independent, solvent, and attractive.","resources":"Customers, performance, hospitality, private rooms, and information from voluntary conversation.","fracture":"Owners, employees, independent workers, and landlords have different ideas of a fair bargain.","privatePressure":"Rising rents could dismantle profitable businesses without reducing demand for their work.","offer":"Warmth, friendship, employment, introductions, and a place to build a social life.","cost":"Loyalty can mean taking sides in a friend’s dispute or losing a lucrative patron.","id":"7d144b33-31f6-5ed1-9b02-4f11c404d258","seatLocationId":"e0526a03-fbb9-5eb9-bdbd-31872d63f11b","associatedCharacterIds":["9ed7daa2-a0a3-52cf-b7f4-ad8d220750ab","ab4cfd68-d04d-5ebb-b874-e33648cca0c3","65bf20fb-85f1-51f2-8b4a-cfe7cee517ef","78bb861c-ec4e-5acb-9a14-211d669a33c6","c08888b0-bc02-502f-a0ac-eacfef8b5388","2aedb376-b459-54f7-ae2e-4a2251f295c7","aa9e4ede-81e0-5b52-a1cc-90e086016028","38c61131-14a4-5a14-9165-d307095419ba","227c6912-aa1c-56e7-ac17-06e97a40ffab","413d9066-13cf-5dcc-acb7-6dcf0c8d506c","a71259b6-01ca-57c1-b8f6-1f4a2ed5d8d3","48948de7-27bd-5a3c-8053-3afa6e59f55d","9ed8bf33-40ad-580c-baff-ce50e70870e7"]},{"slug":"old-road-network","name":"Old Road Carriers","publicAim":"Keep goods and people moving beyond the expensive main crossing.","resources":"Riders, animals, caches, repair skills, alternate routes, and household trust.","fracture":"Ordinary delivery, fee evasion, and serious theft are different undertakings that some brokers blur.","privatePressure":"An increasingly valuable sealed consignment threatens the network’s narrow tolerances.","offer":"Work, mobility, practical assistance, and a chance to help people bypass a bottleneck.","cost":"Incomplete information, disputed cargo ownership, and exposure to accusations by association.","id":"43db065f-bc9c-56df-84e1-bc02a23b7d36","seatLocationId":"96ed8d24-eb88-5fa9-ae9c-45257c6c6221","associatedCharacterIds":["db699624-91b3-5c34-93ec-53c7974498fb","1da2