ms are individually assigned.","socialTexture":"Breakfast is quick, supper communal, and late arrivals quiet. Agnes notices an absence but does not know its cause until someone tells her.","authorOnlyPrivateTruth":"She has delayed several evictions by drawing on her own repair savings. Her generosity has a limit she finds painful to name.","storySeeds":["A wage delay becomes a household problem.","A departing boarder leaves a useful possession with conflicting instructions."],"activities":["lodging","shared meals","porch visits","household errands"],"visualAnchors":["long supper table","repaired stair rail","porch rocking chair","numbered room keys"],"etiquette":"Being a guest does not grant access to another resident’s room. Help with expenses should preserve dignity and clear terms.","primaryCharacterIds":["2a838e0f-f2e8-582a-8925-1380e8f9cc3b"],"regularCharacterIds":["2a838e0f-f2e8-582a-8925-1380e8f9cc3b","c48b4d60-f01d-50e5-8a74-f5c7977df0b5","b884dee9-b258-5d00-97cd-16a401685fa6"],"visitorHours":{"opens":"05:00","closes":"23:00","overnight":false,"timezone":"user_local"},"access":{"mode":"public_frontage","initiallyDiscoverable":true,"requiredState":null,"privateAreasRequireInvitation":true},"imagePrompt":"Fictional territorial Southwest, 1888. Boatmen’s Boardinghouse: A boardinghouse offering solid meals, modest rooms, and a household rhythm that gives working residents somewhere to return to. Show long supper table, repaired stair rail, porch rocking chair, numbered room keys. A common dining room and sitting porch are public to guests and invited visitors. Bedrooms are private; kitchen and account desk are work spaces. Separate rooms are individually assigned. A single coherent, inhabited architectural scene; period materials, natural light, no text or logo.","asset":{"key":"calders-run-boatmens-boardinghouse","status":"not_generated"}},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-0