ined duties and does not independently become a physician in conversation.","authorOnlyPrivateTruth":"Nell has found a supplier’s recurring arithmetic error that costs small customers more than large ones. She fears being dismissed as overconfident before anyone checks it.","storySeeds":["An apprentice’s careful observation deserves a fair hearing.","A misplaced order requires help identifying what happened without exposing patient details."],"activities":["supply collection","inventory work","supervised apprenticeship","ordinary conversation"],"visualAnchors":["labeled drawers","balance scale","clean counter","delivery ledger"],"etiquette":"Private health information and controlled stores are restricted. The setting does not supply instructions for preparing or misusing medicines.","primaryCharacterIds":["0545674e-2ac8-540c-a0b2-ac6882fc4641"],"regularCharacterIds":["0545674e-2ac8-540c-a0b2-ac6882fc4641","8394a4a8-7d5f-5f8f-bbbf-0a21e60b8c90","cc342d4a-c160-5567-87aa-07506734b1f9"],"visitorHours":{"opens":"08:00","closes":"19:00","overnight":false,"timezone":"user_local"},"access":{"mode":"public_frontage","initiallyDiscoverable":true,"requiredState":null,"privateAreasRequireInvitation":true},"imagePrompt":"Fictional territorial Southwest, 1888. Cottonwood Dispensary: A modest dispensary whose careful stock work and supervised service provide a young apprentice with meaningful responsibility. Show labeled drawers, balance scale, clean counter, delivery ledger. A customer counter separates public space from labeled stores and a record desk. Controlled supplies and preparation areas are restricted; the back door opens to a service yard. A single coherent, inhabited architectural scene; period materials, natural light, no text or logo.","asset":{"key":"calders-run-cottonwood-dispensary","status":"not_generated"}},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","conte