ay ignores.","layout":"A public waiting room and meal counter face the yard. Stables, stores, route records, and private rooms have separate access. The surrounding road is a travel route, not another room.","socialTexture":"Early departures and late arrivals bracket quieter maintenance hours. Bad conditions can extend stays, but those delays must be tied to actual weather and story state.","authorOnlyPrivateTruth":"Sadie has accepted a preliminary offer for scheduled railway feeder work. It would stabilize income while requiring her to stop carrying certain independent consignments.","storySeeds":["A storm-bound evening creates an unexpected friendship.","A sensible contract would force a driver to disappoint people who relied on her."],"activities":["coach travel","meals","shelter","route planning"],"visualAnchors":["long water trough","coach yard","worn meal counter","road disappearing between bluffs"],"etiquette":"Travel requires time and available service. Shared shelter does not force companionship, room sharing, or romance.","primaryCharacterIds":["07d26fd4-4d0a-5846-8553-91c92a1a8073"],"regularCharacterIds":["07d26fd4-4d0a-5846-8553-91c92a1a8073","db699624-91b3-5c34-93ec-53c7974498fb","dd646eaf-8983-567b-b3c5-00d4f5175b2c"],"visitorHours":{"opens":"05:00","closes":"22:00","overnight":false,"timezone":"user_local"},"access":{"mode":"public_frontage","initiallyDiscoverable":true,"requiredState":null,"privateAreasRequireInvitation":true},"imagePrompt":"Fictional territorial Southwest, 1888. Widow’s Cut Coach Station: An isolated coach station offering rest, repairs, food, and the unusual intimacy of strangers waiting for the same road to become passable. Show long water trough, coach yard, worn meal counter, road disappearing between bluffs. A public waiting room and meal counter face the yard. Stables, stores, route records, and private rooms have separate access. The surrounding road is a travel route, not another room. A single coherent, inhabited architectu