aim has modest evidence of value and a great deal of rumor attached to it.","layout":"A visitor shelter and sample table stand beside approved surface workings. Excavations, stored tools, and the private camp require permission. Hazardous areas are not public exploration shortcuts.","socialTexture":"Work starts early to avoid the worst heat. Afternoon sorting and records allow conversation, while long supply trips occasionally replace a workday.","authorOnlyPrivateTruth":"Kit’s most exciting sample may have come from material deposited by an earlier owner. She wants to establish its origin before either celebrating or giving up.","storySeeds":["A hopeful find requires an honest test.","A friend offers capital that would change who controls the claim."],"activities":["claim appointments","surface observation","sample discussion","camp meals by invitation"],"visualAnchors":["red earth","sample table","patched shade shelter","carefully repaired tools"],"etiquette":"The claim is a workplace and home. Visitors do not enter workings or remove material without a specific agreement.","primaryCharacterIds":["b118391c-c144-5e58-9bda-6ccc7a100d38"],"regularCharacterIds":["b118391c-c144-5e58-9bda-6ccc7a100d38","cc342d4a-c160-5567-87aa-07506734b1f9","82e1ec55-9183-5279-a7f8-1e62d54061b1"],"visitorHours":{"opens":"06:00","closes":"19:00","overnight":false,"timezone":"user_local"},"access":{"mode":"public_frontage","initiallyDiscoverable":true,"requiredState":null,"privateAreasRequireInvitation":true},"imagePrompt":"Fictional territorial Southwest, 1888. Red Wells Prospect: A small independent claim where hope, discipline, and borrowed resources meet a landscape that offers no guarantee of rewarding hard work. Show red earth, sample table, patched shade shelter, carefully repaired tools. A visitor shelter and sample table stand beside approved surface workings. Excavations, stored tools, and the private camp require permission. Hazardous areas are not public exploration shortcuts.