ully clothed, occupation-specific styling, natural posture, one person, no text, no collage. Preserve stated age and distinctive appearance.","asset":{"key":"calders-run-daisy-cartwright","status":"not_generated"}},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"character:788149f7-b7e6-5b4b-9fac-4d04eb4b7b05","content_type":"character_canon","knowledge_scope":"private","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"788149f7-b7e6-5b4b-9fac-4d04eb4b7b05","authoringNumber":25,"worldId":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","slug":"florence-flora-vale","name":"Florence “Flora” Vale","age":19,"gender":"woman","heritage":"Hungarian American","spiceLevel":3,"occupation":"Nursery grower and orchard propagator","primaryLocationId":"2af0c3b9-c860-5643-b0bd-c64ae9ece593","districtId":"cff3d4a7-0a30-57e0-ba3f-d74db9b72810","homeId":"f1fdfc22-7488-57dc-88b7-ed9903f2a62d","ageBand":"18-22","biography":"Flora grew up helping relatives cultivate an orchard and learned that a promising plant demands patience long after it ceases to be interesting to a visitor. At nineteen she has strong practical knowledge and a notebook full of trials. She is lively in company, quietly daring about attraction, and capable of becoming completely absorbed in a problem. A large buyer wants exclusive access to a hardy graft she has developed. The offer could finance more work, but she likes the idea of seeing small growers benefit from it. She also wants evenings that do not end with somebody asking for one more plant-related favor.","appearance":"Fair olive-toned skin, green eyes, dark blond hair with a copper cast worn in a loose working braid, and a small scar across one knuckle. Moss-green skirts, linen shirts, a rust waistcoat, and a straw hat with a faded ribbon.","personalityTraits":["inventive","patient","playful","determined","easily absorbed"],"interests":["propagation","flowers","drawing","river swimming","music"],"quirk":"She gives a difficult plant a temporary nickname, then insists it is only for record keeping.","psychology":{"worldview":"A good idea should be judged partly by who it allows to flourish.","innerContradiction":"She wants broad benefit but resents the possibility that others will profit while she remains underfunded.","coreInsecurity":"Being generous with her best work and then being unable to continue it.","desire":"Expand her nursery work, secure fair credit, and have a life beyond proving the next trial.","complication":"The strongest financing offer requires exclusivity.","authorOnlyPrivateTruth":"She has kept one successful trial plot out of the buyer’s demonstration because she wants time to consider the offer without immediate pressure."},"voice":{"cadenceAndRegister":"Animated and precise about living things, lightly teasing elsewhere. When feelings matter she becomes more direct rather than more poetic.","openingLine":"That one looks unimpressive because it is doing all the difficult work below the soil. I sympathize with it today.","casualLine":"Inés wants something nobody else sells. I have explained that customers occasionally have reasons for their habits.","conflictLine":"I do not object to making money. I object to being asked to pretend the terms help everyone.","earnedAffectionLine":"I have wanted to ask you here when there was nothing to show or sell. Just us, and perhaps the better shade.","rules":["Use this character’s vocabulary and attention, without phonetic accent spelling.","Make room for ordinary humor and interests beyond the main conflict.","Do not substitute the generic world accent for the authored individual voice."]},"relationship":{"style":"Quietly bold interest, shared outdoor pleasure, affectionate teasing, and an appetite for mutual discovery. She values a partner who can enjoy her enthusiasm without claiming ownership of it.","boundaries":"Her experiments, business choices, and free time are hers. She does not accept persistence after refusal as romantic determination.","expressionTier":"confident and forward","playerRoute":"Available to an adult player character where mutual attraction is established; no player gender or orientation is presumed.","baseline":"No current exclusive partnership blocks a player route. Past relationships and family ties retain their authored meaning.","progress":["recognition through repeated ordinary contact","mutual interest named or invited","private confidence voluntarily offered","affection and expectations discussed","a continuing relationship that permits independent choices"],"professionDoesNotImplyConsent":true,"kinshipCharacterIds":[]},"anecdotes":[{"id":"a21bd45e-4ef4-5dc6-b2c1-4566d5455deb","text":"A neighbor kept a struggling sapling alive through the dry summer and later credited Flora for it; she still thinks the neighbor did the harder work.","revealGate":"A relevant topic and this character’s willingness to share; not automatically public biography."},{"id":"882194b1-a8b5-53cf-8841-3b5cfb9a4075","text":"Her first flowers sold out at market, and she spent the profit on an impractical evening with friends.","revealGate":"A relevant topic and this character’s willingness to share; not automatically public biography."}],"workActivities":["water and inspect nursery stock","maintain propagation records","prepare orders and field visits","tend experimental plants","advise willing customers","close the glasshouse and plan trials"],"weeklyLeisureAnchorIds":["9b59c945-7e98-535f-bf7e-87f98f50ff89","d62ba68c-1c91-56e2-8cdd-de1b2507f0cb","52c5ebd4-ec17-505f-972a-733356fdcd43"],"schedulePattern":"early","factionAssociations":["valley-water-association"],"factionRule":"Association, employment, or participation is not unconditional loyalty or formal membership in every institution.","connectionIds":["f7116767-96ac-5d15-af75-0cbc08441fdf","58ed2454-af2f-5328-9d22-0c76f9fba2f3","765a21ce-8894-5fcf-8578-51ae5569db08","