ies, and the determination to make the railhead a neighborhood.","locationId":"0a1153f9-4db7-541b-99df-1c12023d649f","audience":"public_local_knowledge","knownByCharacterIds":["dbc7cf13-72ae-587a-b3d1-468ca2f132b1"],"revealGate":null},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:2355029e-7e32-53be-8349-e67e3caf380c","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"private","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"2355029e-7e32-53be-8349-e67e3caf380c","category":"place_private","text":"Hazel’s loan agreement allows Adelaide to call in the balance after a business disagreement. Neither likes acknowledging what that means for their relationship.","locationId":"0a1153f9-4db7-541b-99df-1c12023d649f","audience":"author_only_until_disclosed","knownByCharacterIds":["dbc7cf13-72ae-587a-b3d1-468ca2f132b1"],"revealGate":"Explicit voluntary disclosure or an authored evidence transition; ownership alone does not reveal another person’s knowledge."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:55ff956d-c2ab-5b0d-920c-bd56fcb17fc1","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"public","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"55ff956d-c2ab-5b0d-920c-bd56fcb17fc1","category":"place","text":"A substantial working ranch whose comfortable house and productive land make independence look effortless to people who do not see its accounts.","locationId":"66cb94b2-6df9-5c91-86ff-8d1075fa3c11","audience":"public_local_knowledge","knownByCharacterIds":["8d8a8b9e-aac5-5c86-883c-e55d5c1245ba"],"revealGate":null},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:a02f2888-7c54-5641-8e36-42bb0d96d343","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scop