closure or an authored evidence transition; ownership alone does not reveal another person’s knowledge."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:16b6821e-2ccd-52a5-82fd-5823ebf32024","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"public","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"16b6821e-2ccd-52a5-82fd-5823ebf32024","category":"place","text":"A shaded river bend for guided fishing, picnics, swimming when conditions permit, and the feeling of being briefly beyond the town’s demands.","locationId":"d62ba68c-1c91-56e2-8cdd-de1b2507f0cb","audience":"public_local_knowledge","knownByCharacterIds":["1da23f8d-f6c7-5bf5-8da7-e40715399063"],"revealGate":null},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:1822ba02-783c-5673-8b85-7f8299750327","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"private","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"1822ba02-783c-5673-8b85-7f8299750327","category":"place_private","text":"A proposed leisure concession would give a single business control over access that several households currently share. Lena has not accepted its offer of a management role.","locationId":"d62ba68c-1c91-56e2-8cdd-de1b2507f0cb","audience":"author_only_until_disclosed","knownByCharacterIds":["1da23f8d-f6c7-5bf5-8da7-e40715399063"],"revealGate":"Explicit voluntary disclosure or an authored evidence transition; ownership alone does not reveal another person’s knowledge."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:b6fcdb02-e2d2-5a14-bc8b-e4539cc307c2","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"public","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"b6fcdb02-e2d2-5a14-bc8b-e4539cc307c2","category":"place","text"