oring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:154b74da-2538-5542-a983-b3e44072d06b","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"private","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"154b74da-2538-5542-a983-b3e44072d06b","category":"place_private","text":"Two apparently similar sample lots have inconsistent identifying seals. Vera cannot tell which account is true until the custody record is compared.","locationId":"4c788a8a-77fd-5fd4-8be8-e4b7a1d9aac0","audience":"author_only_until_disclosed","knownByCharacterIds":["cc342d4a-c160-5567-87aa-07506734b1f9"],"revealGate":"Explicit voluntary disclosure or an authored evidence transition; ownership alone does not reveal another person’s knowledge."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:cdf0bd5f-17df-55db-b4d3-ede3a4cd458d","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"public","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"cdf0bd5f-17df-55db-b4d3-ede3a4cd458d","category":"place","text":"An isolated coach station offering rest, repairs, food, and the unusual intimacy of strangers waiting for the same road to become passable.","locationId":"24b62a9d-2605-5f9b-985d-816d3bc5da91","audience":"public_local_knowledge","knownByCharacterIds":["07d26fd4-4d0a-5846-8553-91c92a1a8073"],"revealGate":null},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:ae01bddf-9bbc-5807-a470-859d68ffbb04","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"private","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"ae01bddf-9bbc-5807-a470-859d68ffbb04","category":"place_private","text":"Sadie has accepted a preliminary offer for scheduled railway feeder work. It would stabilize income while requiring her to stop carrying certain independent consignments.","locationId":"24b62a9d-2605-5f9b-