etadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:c7a0e2c4-f6c7-5c92-91d3-50ff46f91e79","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"private","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"c7a0e2c4-f6c7-5c92-91d3-50ff46f91e79","category":"place_private","text":"An old burial register includes a duplicated surname and an uncertain date. It may correct a family story but does not prove a concealed murder.","locationId":"dba2f892-1aef-540f-a8b5-7e443589774b","audience":"author_only_until_disclosed","knownByCharacterIds":["de185ba5-cd6b-5022-80cd-8669cc8cfaf2"],"revealGate":"Explicit voluntary disclosure or an authored evidence transition; ownership alone does not reveal another person’s knowledge."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:ef89dae3-6a13-5284-9163-cc6ec954aa86","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"public","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"ef89dae3-6a13-5284-9163-cc6ec954aa86","category":"place","text":"An old relay station that gives independent carriers a place to change animals, leave agreed consignments, and weigh how much they need to know.","locationId":"96ed8d24-eb88-5fa9-ae9c-45257c6c6221","audience":"public_local_knowledge","knownByCharacterIds":["dd646eaf-8983-567b-b3c5-00d4f5175b2c"],"revealGate":null},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:cea2afec-df65-51f0-90b5-54777de8e15e","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"private","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"cea2afec-df65-51f0-90b5-54777de8e15e","category":"place_private","text":"Eve has refused one consignment after noticing that its stated owner and delivery instructions conflict. She retained only the authorized receipt, not omniscient knowledge of its contents.","locationId":"96ed8d24-eb88-5fa9-ae9c-45257c6c6221","audience":"author_only_until_disclosed","knownByCharacterIds":["dd646eaf-8983-567b-b3c5-00d4f5175b2c"],"revealGate":"Explicit voluntary disclosure or an authored evidence transition; ownership alone does not reveal another person’s knowledge."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:83ae991e-cb57-5653-91c8-052bdfb78fce","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"public","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"83ae991e-cb57-5653-91c8-052bdfb78fce","category":"place","text":"The Red Sash is a working brothel with a lively downstairs parlor, adult resident workers, and a practical struggle over how its profits and rules should be shared.","locationId":"38b0efd4-b1d9-5b32-bc1f-b0b711da47ca","audience":"public_local_knowledge","knownByCharacterIds":["48948de7-27bd-5a3c-8053-3afa6e59f55d","9ed8bf33-40ad-580c-baff-ce50e70870e7"],"revealGate":null},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:150efeb1-c9b8-5470-858d-d4aef96240df","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"private","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"150efeb1-c9b8-5470-858d-d4aef96240df","category":"place_private","text":"The lease permits a resident association to submit a purchase proposal, but the owner’s agent has never volunteered that clause. Sabine has found it; financing and collective agreement remain unresolved.","locationId":"38b0efd4-b1d9-5b32-bc1f-b0b711da47ca","audience":"author_only_until_disclosed","knownByCharacterIds":["48948de7-27bd-5a3c-8053-3afa6e59f55d","9ed8bf33-40ad-580c-baff-ce50e70870e7"],"revealGate":"Explicit voluntary disclosure or an authored evidence transition; ownership alone does not reveal another person’s knowledge."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:780a84ae-bd70-5684-9d69-8210a8b98027","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"private","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"780a84ae-bd70-5684-9d69-8210a8b98027","category":"place","text":"Crowcut Hollow is a remote bandit hideout in a side canyon, built around an abandoned freight shelter and the uneasy domestic life of people living beyond ordinary protection.","locationId":"cd490e32-1392-5575-91ea-f8d60722de15","audience":"story_gated_local_knowledge","knownByCharacterIds":["bac209b8-8ee8-50c9-894d-5b767392884a","cdfe583e-b242-5539-93db-a1fa9477ce30"],"revealGate":"crowcut.name_known"},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:b12c66c3-6a22-5b82-a88c-96d709aa0e98","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"private","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"b12c66c3-6a22-5b82-a88c-96d709aa0e98","category":"place_private","text":"Cole knows that one recent robbery harmed ordinary wage earners after Silas described the cargo as company money. Silas knew the distinction and concealed it from some crew members.","locationId":"cd490e32-1392-5575-91ea-f8d60722de15","audience":"author_only_until_disclosed","knownByCharacterIds":["cdfe583e-b242-5539-93db-a1fa9477ce30"],"revealGate":"Explicit voluntary disclosure or an authored evidence transition; ownership alone does not reveal another person’s knowledge.","partialKnowledge":[{"characterId":"bac209b8-8ee8-50c9-894d-5b767392884a","text":"Cole knows he participated in the theft and later discovered that the money included workers’ wages. He does not initially know that Silas knew beforehand."}]},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:3343e08c-b605-559d-9cd6-cde7b617a98b","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"private","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"3343e08c-b605-559d-9cd6-cde7b617a98b","category":"character_private","text":"She has already drafted a counteroffer to Halden’s financing contact; her confident dismissal of the proposal hides serious consideration.","locationId":"e0526a03-fbb9-5eb9-bdbd-31872d63f11b","audience":"owner_private","knownByCharacterIds":["9ed7daa2-a0a3-52cf-b7f4-ad8d220750ab"],"revealGate":"The owner voluntarily discloses this fact, or an arc explicitly establishes this particular fact through evidence. General trust never unlocks every secret."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:73f2982d-620e-5669-8c6c-946011eb4de0","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"private","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"73f2982d-620e-5669-8c6c-946011eb4de0","category":"character_private","text":"She has considered joining a larger practice elsewhere, then hidden the correspondence because it feels like abandoning people who depend on her.","locationId":"41f0e160-b457-5611-9cb3-e6d9cbca84e4","audience":"owner_private","knownByCharacterIds":["8394a4a8-7d5f-5f8f-bbbf-0a21e60b8c90"],"revealGate":"The owner voluntarily discloses this fact, or an arc explicitly establishes this particular fact through evidence. General trust never unlocks every secret."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:551ee909-998a-5750-bd3a-dac5a4287223","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"private","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"551ee909-998a-5750-bd3a-dac5a4287223","category":"character_private","text":"She made an early estimate too confidently an