ct through evidence. General trust never unlocks every secret."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:9fa7bc0c-4c29-5f41-a70d-6697e61fd141","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"private","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"9fa7bc0c-4c29-5f41-a70d-6697e61fd141","category":"character_private","text":"She knows a neighbor understood a water promise as permanent while she treated it as a revocable accommodation.","locationId":"66cb94b2-6df9-5c91-86ff-8d1075fa3c11","audience":"owner_private","knownByCharacterIds":["8d8a8b9e-aac5-5c86-883c-e55d5c1245ba"],"revealGate":"The owner voluntarily discloses this fact, or an arc explicitly establishes this particular fact through evidence. General trust never unlocks every secret."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:397f5ce9-9f75-583d-bdb5-cc1efb7dede7","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"private","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"397f5ce9-9f75-583d-bdb5-cc1efb7dede7","category":"character_private","text":"She accepted a horse on weak paperwork because she wanted to believe the seller; she is now trying to establish its ownership before asking for help.","locationId":"602be10b-b09b-58df-965e-033a1ea401d8","audience":"owner_private","knownByCharacterIds":["db699624-91b3-5c34-93ec-53c7974498fb"],"revealGate":"The owner voluntarily discloses this fact, or an arc explicitly establishes this particular fact through evidence. General trust never unlocks every secret."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:01952e80-3997-52fc-921b-0f19d1940803","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"private","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"01952e80-3997-52fc-921b-0f19d1940803","category":"character_private","text":"She has considered selling a partial interest in the property to secure the workers’ future, although the arrangement could reduce her own control.","locationId":"15e01963-8be0-5523-b708-90c6ed3f5ad3","audience":"owner_private","knownByCharacterIds":["65bf20fb-85f1-51f2-8b4a-cfe7cee517ef"],"revealGate":"The owner voluntarily discloses this fact, or an arc explicitly establishes this particular fact through evidence. General trust never unlocks every secret."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:ce9599de-044b-5074-8e70-e2defed8a16d","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"private","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"ce9599de-044b-5074-8e70-e2defed8a16d","category":"character_private","text":"She has a small notebook of plans for another kitchen and has priced the equipment, even while telling Gin she is committed to staying.","locationId":"1a511bfe-6c6d-5942-bbae-6f85fa2a7217","audience":"owner_private","knownByCharacterIds":["78bb861c-ec4e-5acb-9a14-211d669a33c6"],"revealGate":"The owner voluntarily discloses this fact, or an arc explicitly establishes this particular fact through evidence. General trust never unlocks every secret."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:5c8b70fb-537c-550c-85bd-ed711931fe99","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"private","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"5c8b70fb-537c-550c-85bd-ed711931fe99","category":"character_private","text":"She has been invited to try a season with a traveling dance company and has told nobody because she is not sure she wants it.","locationId":"83833b22-7a11-59ac-b4ee-27cea0e3c35b","audience":"owner_private","knownByCharacterIds":["c08888b0-bc02-502f-a0ac-eacfef8b5388"],"revealGate":"The owner voluntarily discloses this fact, or an arc explicitly establishes this particular fact through evidence. General trust never unlocks every secret."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:934351e2-54b7-524f-b7dc-d1e54e1263bb","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"private","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"934351e2-54b7-524f-b7dc-d1e54e1263bb","category":"character_private","text":"She has copied her own authorized maintenance reports so an employer cannot later claim she never raised concerns.","locationId":"1382bb5d-2704-5ff2-a0b4-23707e0219e3","audience":"owner_private","knownByCharacterIds":["2aedb376-b459-54f7-ae2e-4a2251f295c7"],"revealGate":"The owner voluntarily discloses this fact, or an arc explicitly establishes this particular fact through evidence. General trust never unlocks every secret."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:ebc7176c-d35e-5dba-8d21-a1a2f9761e6d","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"private","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"ebc7176c-d35e-5dba-8d21-a1a2f9761e6d","category":"character_private","text":"She has been writing letters to an imaginary future household as a way of discovering what domestic life she wants; they are private exercises, not messages to a secret lover.","locationId":"fd31aebd-9627-5eb6-aa48-992466e453ee","audience":"owner_private","knownByCharacterIds":["aa9e4ede-81e0-5b52-a1cc-90e086016028"],"revealGate":"The owner voluntarily discloses this fact, or an arc explicitly establishes this particular fact through evidence. General trust never unlocks every secret."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},