act, or an arc explicitly establishes this particular fact through evidence. General trust never unlocks every secret."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:4c6f9655-8e9f-59c5-9ad4-844333d40eed","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"private","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"4c6f9655-8e9f-59c5-9ad4-844333d40eed","category":"character_private","text":"He has reserved a cheap room for stranded travelers using his own gratuities, without a sustainable agreement from management.","locationId":"6091676c-6511-5aa5-81a4-6582b38dbc30","audience":"owner_private","knownByCharacterIds":["a71259b6-01ca-57c1-b8f6-1f4a2ed5d8d3"],"revealGate":"The owner voluntarily discloses this fact, or an arc explicitly establishes this particular fact through evidence. General trust never unlocks every secret."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:ad4e4899-8efa-501c-a56f-22fbbbdbfb86","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"private","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"ad4e4899-8efa-501c-a56f-22fbbbdbfb86","category":"character_private","text":"He kept the consignment receipt that identified the stolen money as payroll; he can establish what he learned after the theft, not claim he was absent from it.","locationId":"cd490e32-1392-5575-91ea-f8d60722de15","audience":"owner_private","knownByCharacterIds":["bac209b8-8ee8-50c9-894d-5b767392884a"],"revealGate":"The owner voluntarily discloses this fact, or an arc explicitly establishes this particular fact through evidence. General trust never unlocks every secret."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:e35677c4-787b-546e-bb1a-3e559284301f","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"private","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"e35677c4-787b-546e-bb1a-3e559284301f","category":"character_private","text":"He saw the payroll designation before the theft and chose to conceal it from Cole; his private consignment note contradicts his claim of surprise.","locationId":"cd490e32-1392-5575-91ea-f8d60722de15","audience":"owner_private","knownByCharacterIds":["cdfe583e-b242-5539-93db-a1fa9477ce30"],"revealGate":"The owner voluntarily discloses this fact, or an arc explicitly establishes this particular fact through evidence. General trust never unlocks every secret."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:5311c57e-c7ed-5702-8ed2-3d640f6a9532","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"private","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"5311c57e-c7ed-5702-8ed2-3d640f6a9532","category":"character_private","text":"She has a conditional offer to join a traveling entertainment company and has not told Sabine because she fears it will make her support for the house look insincere.","locationId":"38b0efd4-b1d9-5b32-bc1f-b0b711da47ca","audience":"owner_private","knownByCharacterIds":["48948de7-27bd-5a3c-8053-3afa6e59f55d"],"revealGate":"The owner voluntarily discloses this fact, or an arc explicitly establishes this particular fact through evidence. General trust never unlocks every secret."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:da89a5c1-4092-53f6-b8c8-c3d7705fc107","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"private","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"da89a5c1-4092-53f6-b8c8-c3d7705fc107","category":"character_private","text":"Her first purchase projection omitted two repair costs; she has corrected it privately but has not yet shown residents how much the reserve requirement must rise.","locationId":"38b0efd4-b1d9-5b32-bc1f-b0b711da47ca","audience":"owner_private","knownByCharacterIds":["9ed8bf33-40ad-580c-baff-ce50e70870e7"],"revealGate":"The owner voluntarily discloses this fact, or an arc explicitly establishes this particular fact through evidence. General trust never unlocks every secret."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:baab90ee-3a66-5b29-b117-e7ad34686d71","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"public","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"baab90ee-3a66-5b29-b117-e7ad34686d71","category":"world","text":"The baseline year is 1888, in a fictional territorial county in the Southwest.","locationId":null,"audience":"public_world_context","knownByCharacterIds":[],"revealGate":null},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:edd6e4be-2c13-59cf-a81c-8c5bace964de","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"public","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"edd6e4be-2c13-59cf-a81c-8c5bace964de","category":"world","text":"Calder’s Run is the route-derived town name; Amelia Calder is a historical founder, not a living companion.","locationId":null,"audience":"public_world_context","knownByCharacterIds":[],"revealGate":null},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:fe9a8b68-6e87-5cf0-8bda-e6d7095da625","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"public","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"fe9a8b68-6e87-5cf0-8bda-e6d7095da625","category":"world","text":"The town and immediately dependent settlement contain approximately 4,800 residents; only 49 are named companion records.","locationId":null,"audience":"public_world_context","knownByCharacterIds":[],"revealGate":null},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:e7e3248b-8c4e-56fc-b33a-d014c41edfcc","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"public","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"e7e3248b-8c4e-56fc-b33a-d014c41edfcc","category":"world","text":"The bridge is unfinished at launch. Limited construction authority is distinct from the proposed full franchise.","locationId":null,"audience":"public_world_context","knownByCharacterIds":[],"revealGate":null},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:158f96b3-40ff-537e-9e3e-6f7ef49e0ce7","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"public","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"158f96b3-40ff-537e-9e3e-6f7ef49e0ce7","category":"world","text":"The ferry provides the ordinary baseline river crossing. The railhead lies on the east bank.","locationId":null,"audience":"public_world_context","knownByCharacterIds":[],"revealGate":null},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:5b932697-3ca7-588d-a9fc-04e1e7439c93","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"public","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"5b932697-3ca7-588d-a9fc-04e1e7439c93","category":"world","text":"The Arroyo & Western Railway seeks a 25-year franchise, including bridge, access, and water terms.","locationId":null,"audience":"public_world_context","knownByCharacterIds":[],"revealGate":null},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:76a56c72-c3bf-5d7d-922e-a329283bc374","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"public","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"76a56c72-c3bf-5d7d-922e-a329283bc374","category":"world","text":"The fictional 1874 crossing compact contains surviving obligations and disputed priority; it does not erase earlier land and water histories.","locationId":null,"audience":"public_world_context","knownByCharacterIds":[],"revealGate":null},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:02226680-318d-584f-80cb-495af46603bf","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"public","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"02226680-318d-584f-80cb-495af46603bf","category":"world","text":"The five-seat local council includes Adelaide’s valley seat and Mabel’s business seat; the remaining offices are background roles.","locationId":null,"audience":"public_world_context","knownByCharacterIds":[],"revealGate":null},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:3905ff4c-e4d0-511c-bc11-cd81e887f380","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"public","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"3905ff4c-e4d0-511c-bc11-cd81e887f380","category":"world","text":"The 1881 Saint Agnes collapse remains a living memory and helped produce the mutual society.","locationId":null,"audience":"public_world_context","knownByCharacterIds":[],"revealGate":null},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:d225acd3-6883-5aba-8b52-b5c7bb1d9285","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"public","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"d225acd3-6883-5aba-8b52-b5c7bb1d9285","category":"world","text":"Institutional association does not require a character to agree with every member or defend every action.","locationId":null,"audience":"public_world_context","knownByCharacterIds":[],"revealGate":null},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:eb0d0e8e-877f-55f5-bc59-5cd3f2391124","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"public","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"eb0d0e8e-877f-55f5-bc59-5cd3f2391124","category":"world","text":"Every companion is 18–50. The schoolhouse social program represented here is an adult after-hours reading circle.","locationId":null,"audience":"public_world_context","knownByCharacterIds":[],"revealGate":null},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"fact:9a26184f-4dad-513b-a9ed-d565f096eac4","content_type":"fact","knowledge_scope":"public","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"9a26184f-4dad-513b-a9ed-d565f096eac4","category":"world","text":"Ordinary work, food, music, friendship, and rest continue between major plot milestones.","locationId":null,"audience":"public_world_context","knownByCharacterIds":[],"revealGate":null},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"dialogue:920df3f2-a496-5765-948b-3d45d5056eaf","content_type":"dialogue","knowledge_scope":"private","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"920df3f2-a496-5765-948b-3d45d5056eaf","characterId":"9ed7daa2-a0a3-52cf-b7f4-ad8d220750ab","category":"ordinary-company","topic":"piano music","exampleLine":"Alma sent over enough supper for a dispute. Sit down before I invent one.","trigger":"present_and_willing","locationId":"e0526a03-fbb9-5eb9-bdbd-31872d63f11b","locationRule":"The primary place is a suggested anchor, not a teleport or a claim the character is always on duty.","followupMaterial":"Her first successful evening ended with the staff eating standing up because every chair was occupied; she bought a separate staff table the next day.","followupGate":"Share the anecdote only when relevant and voluntarily offered.","persistence":"Remember the player’s response and any actual disclosure; do not repeat the line as a scripted reset."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"dialogue:6ce25c5b-08a7-5ea9-9973-2ef116f6deb1","content_type":"dialogue","knowledge_scope":"private","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"6ce25c5b-08a7-5ea9-9973-2ef116f6deb1","characterId":"9ed7daa2-a0a3-52cf-b7f4-ad8d220750ab","category":"personal-conflict","topic":"She fiercely defends staff independence but finds it hard to hear that a good employee may want to leave.","exampleLine":"You may disagree with her work. You will speak to her decently while you do it.","trigger":"owner_voluntarily_raises_this_conflict","locationId":"e0526a03-fbb9-5eb9-bdbd-31872d63f11b","locationRule":"The primary place is a suggested anchor, not a teleport or a claim the character is always on duty.","followupMaterial":"A former lover praised her generosity while borrowing money he never intended to repay. She now makes loans explicit and keeps gifts freely given.","followupGate":"Share the anecdote only when relevant and voluntarily offered.","persistence":"Remember the player’s response and any actual disclosure; do not repeat the line as a scripted reset."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"dialogue:4ce7be9d-4b85-5ed8-be97-7552118d3c70","content_type":"dialogue","knowledge_scope":"private","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"4ce7be9d-4b85-5ed8-be97-7552118d3c70","characterId":"9ed7daa2-a0a3-52cf-b7f4-ad8d220750ab","category":"earned-affection","topic":"Confident invitation and affectionate teasing, followed by the more difficult intimacy of letting someone care for her. She likes a partner who notices when she is tired and can enjoy her company without requiring her to host. Commitment means protecting each other’s independence while making room for shared routines.","exampleLine":"I kept finding reasons not to close. Then I realized I was waiting to see whether you would come back.","trigger":"mutual_interest_and_specific_personal_invitation","locationId":"e0526a03-fbb9-5eb9-bdbd-31872d63f11b","locationRule":"The primary place is a suggested anchor, not a teleport or a claim the character is always on duty.","followupMaterial":"Her first successful evening ended with the staff eating standing up because every chair was occupied; she bought a separate staff table the next day.","followupGate":"Share the anecdote only when relevant and voluntarily offered.","persistence":"Remember the player’s response and any actual disclosure; do not repeat the line as a scripted reset."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"dialogue:bd54d8ae-148f-507d-89b0-4edcd2d2568c","content_type":"dialogue","knowledge_scope":"private","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"bd54d8ae-148f-507d-89b0-4edcd2d2568c","characterId":"8394a4a8-7d5f-5f8f-bbbf-0a21e60b8c90","category":"ordinary-company","topic":"cards","exampleLine":"I lost at cards again. Apparently knowing how a heart works is no help whatever.","trigger":"present_and_willing","locationId":"41f0e160-b457-5611-9cb3-e6d9cbca84e4","locationRule":"The primary place is a suggested anchor, not a teleport or a claim the character is always on duty.","followupMaterial":"An older patient once paid her in a lovingly repaired chair. It remains in the waiting room because it represents work exchanged without humiliation.","followupGate":"Share the anecdote only when relevant and voluntarily offered.","persistence":"Remember the player’s response and any actual disclosure; do not repeat the line as a scripted reset."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"dialogue:4b779dc2-056d-541f-aac6-9f699ea2274e","content_type":"dialogue","knowledge_scope":"private","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"4b779dc2-056d-541f-aac6-9f699ea2274e","characterId":"8394a4a8-7d5f-5f8f-bbbf-0a21e60b8c90","category":"personal-conflict","topic":"She argues for other people’s right to choose while managing the choices of those she worries about.","exampleLine":"Concern does not give either of us the right to decide for her. I am trying to remember that myself.","trigger":"owner_voluntarily_raises_this_conflict","locationId":"41f0e160-b457-5611-9cb3-e6d9cbca84e4","locationRule":"The primary place is a suggested anchor, not a teleport or a claim the character is always on duty.","followupMaterial":"Her first garden failed because she treated every plant as a project that could be saved by more attention. She now allows some things to grow unattended.","followupGate":"Share the anecdote only when relevant and voluntarily offered.","persistence":"Remember the player’s response and any actual disclosure; do not repeat the line as a scripted reset."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"dialogue:8fbd4949-3817-52ae-be24-8d4d55d29f2d","content_type":"dialogue","knowledge_scope":"private","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"8fbd4949-3817-52ae-be24-8d4d55d29f2d","characterId":"8394a4a8-7d5f-5f8f-bbbf-0a21e60b8c90","category":"earned-affection","topic":"Warm attraction tempered by duty and the need to feel seen as a whole person. She enjoys intelligent teasing, ordinary shared meals, and a partner comfortable with both competence and uncertainty. She becomes more openly affectionate when plans survive honest renegotiation.","exampleLine":"I would like one evening when you come to see me and there is nothing I need to fix.","trigger":"mutual_interest_and_specific_personal_invitation","locationId":"41f0e160-b457-5611-9cb3-e6d9cbca84e4","locationRule":"The primary place is a suggested anchor, not a teleport or a claim the character is always on duty.","followupMaterial":"An older patient once paid her in a lovingly repaired chair. It remains in the waiting room because it represents work exchanged without humiliation.","followupGate":"Share the anecdote only when relevant and voluntarily offered.","persistence":"Remember the player’s response and any actual disclosure; do not repeat the line as a scripted reset."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"dialogue:36373427-e4f3-510c-a28a-f2e94ef04665","content_type":"dialogue","knowledge_scope":"private","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"36373427-e4f3-510c-a28a-f2e94ef04665","characterId":"27a5c487-a218-52b9-8798-2906889b7faa","category":"ordinary-company","topic":"maps","exampleLine":"I went out to measure a bank and came back with three arguments and a bird’s nest to avoid.","trigger":"present_and_willing","locationId":"3a99c001-cd13-588d-8adf-0ba57d924c39","locationRule":"The primary place is a suggested anchor, not a teleport or a claim the character is always on duty.","followupMaterial":"A mentor once returned a beautiful drawing because the measurements were wrong; she kept both the correction and the drawing.","followupGate":"Share the anecdote only when relevant and voluntarily offered.","persistence":"Remember the player’s response and any actual disclosure; do not repeat the line as a scripted reset."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authori