 also has ordinary meals, disagreements, friendships, and time away from work.","possibleCharacterIds":["48948de7-27bd-5a3c-8053-3afa6e59f55d","9ed8bf33-40ad-580c-baff-ce50e70870e7","65bf20fb-85f1-51f2-8b4a-cfe7cee517ef"],"presenceGate":"Use only characters actually present under the saved schedule or an explicit event override.","accessGate":"visitor_frontage_or_specific_invitation","playerChoices":["Join or ask a relevant question.","Offer a specific ordinary contribution and let the character decide.","Observe without assuming private knowledge.","Decline and continue the day."],"context":"Every worker is an adult with independent choice over clients and services. Paid work does not create personal romantic availability. Bess and Sabine are unrelated coworkers, not siblings.","worldStateRule":"A seed invites an authored scene; it does not automatically reveal the location’s private truth or resolve an arc."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"beat:d58cc0f5-b226-56eb-a2bc-2efc07af3add","content_type":"interaction_beat","knowledge_scope":"story","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"d58cc0f5-b226-56eb-a2bc-2efc07af3add","locationId":"38b0efd4-b1d9-5b32-bc1f-b0b711da47ca","category":"story-seed","opening":"Two workers seek a fair purchase arrangement without agreeing on how much risk to take.","possibleCharacterIds":["48948de7-27bd-5a3c-8053-3afa6e59f55d","9ed8bf33-40ad-580c-baff-ce50e70870e7","65bf20fb-85f1-51f2-8b4a-cfe7cee517ef"],"presenceGate":"Use only characters actually present under the saved schedule or an explicit event override.","accessGate":"visitor_frontage_or_specific_invitation","playerChoices":["Join or ask a relevant question.","Offer a specific ordinary contribution and let the character decide.","Observe without assuming private knowledge.","Decline and continue the day."],"context":"Every worker is an adult with independent choice over clients and services. Paid work does not create personal romantic availability. Bess and Sabine are unrelated coworkers, not siblings.","worldStateRule":"A seed invites an authored scene; it does not automatically reveal the location’s private truth or resolve an arc."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"beat:119a85f8-f095-5d53-8a6e-214fd3f1a397","content_type":"interaction_beat","knowledge_scope":"story","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"119a85f8-f095-5d53-8a6e-214fd3f1a397","locationId":"38b0efd4-b1d9-5b32-bc1f-b0b711da47ca","category":"story-seed","opening":"A patron treats a professional preference as a personal promise and must be answered clearly.","possibleCharacterIds":["48948de7-27bd-5a3c-8053-3afa6e59f55d","9ed8bf33-40ad-580c-baff-ce50e70870e7","65bf20fb-85f1-51f2-8b4a-cfe7cee517ef"],"presenceGate":"Use only characters actually present under the saved schedule or an explicit event override.","accessGate":"visitor_frontage_or_specific_invitation","playerChoices":["Join or ask a relevant question.","Offer a specific ordinary contribution and let the character decide.","Observe without assuming private knowledge.","Decline and continue the day."],"context":"Every worker is an adult with independent choice over clients and services. Paid work does not create personal romantic availability. Bess and Sabine are unrelated coworkers, not siblings.","worldStateRule":"A seed invites an authored scene; it does not automatically reveal the location’s private truth or resolve an arc."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"beat:929a6384-5fe0-591f-9cb6-8b716d426e20","content_type":"interaction_beat","knowledge_scope":"story","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"929a6384-5fe