ent override.","accessGate":"crowcut.access_granted","playerChoices":["Join or ask a relevant question.","Offer a specific ordinary contribution and let the character decide.","Observe without assuming private knowledge.","Decline and continue the day."],"context":"Entry requires discovery and an authored access state. An invitation to the communal shelter does not open private sleeping spaces or personal papers. Visitors can decline a meeting or leave; romance does not oblige anyone to join the crew.","worldStateRule":"A seed invites an authored scene; it does not automatically reveal the location’s private truth or resolve an arc."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"beat:75594104-c3ba-5eca-bab0-0cba0c152521","content_type":"interaction_beat","knowledge_scope":"story","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"75594104-c3ba-5eca-bab0-0cba0c152521","locationId":"cd490e32-1392-5575-91ea-f8d60722de15","category":"story-seed","opening":"Returning property, exposing the truth, negotiating surrender, or leaving each creates different continuing consequences.","possibleCharacterIds":["bac209b8-8ee8-50c9-894d-5b767392884a","cdfe583e-b242-5539-93db-a1fa9477ce30","dd646eaf-8983-567b-b3c5-00d4f5175b2c"],"presenceGate":"Use only characters actually present under the saved schedule or an explicit event override.","accessGate":"crowcut.access_granted","playerChoices":["Join or ask a relevant question.","Offer a specific ordinary contribution and let the character decide.","Observe without assuming private knowledge.","Decline and continue the day."],"context":"Entry requires discovery and an authored access state. An invitation to the communal shelter does not open private sleeping spaces or personal papers. Visitors can decline a meeting or leave; romance does not oblige anyone to join the crew.","worldStateRule":"A seed invites an authored scene; it does not automatically reveal the location’s private truth or resolve an arc."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"arc:the-other-bank","content_type":"story_arc","knowledge_scope":"story","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"18ae1411-66ee-5d3e-a8f1-c5d12d6fef35","slug":"the-other-bank","title":"The Other Bank","characterIds":["27a5c487-a218-52b9-8798-2906889b7faa","77ae229b-0456-55e9-bf5a-6358ef347bcc","8d8a8b9e-aac5-5c86-883c-e55d5c1245ba","fe0749b0-c5c5-5fb0-825c-5faae2bb1360","e35b15cf-fcb2-5955-829c-3cb37661c7ac","17799880-e679-5080-b921-b9f4afa3b6fb","227c6912-aa1c-56e7-ac17-06e97a40ffab"],"locationIds":["3a99c001-cd13-588d-8adf-0ba57d924c39","ec896c98-a5c1-5cdc-b6e9-96cdefc12925","048903b9-a546-5386-93f1-5ae6ff7462dc","12a6914f-0fe4-544d-bfe9-b36c97ea81e8","aac1591a-0117-5969-b59e-1f2d6b1b1ab1"],"openingHook":"A hot wind takes a survey sheet across the yard just as two people arrive asking Tess to sign different versions of the same conclusion.","stakes":"The bridge could shorten journeys and secure east-bank livelihoods. Its preferred approach would also strengthen the railway’s control of access and disturb existing water use. Supporting a bridge is not a vote for every term attached to it.","clues":[{"id":"053a331d-a699-50b8-8fde-9f343d641e7a","slug":"alternate-survey","title":"Tess’s qualified alternative survey","holderCharacterId":"27a5c487-a218-52b9-8798-2906889b7faa","originLocationId":"3a99c001-cd13-588d-8adf-0ba57d924c39","revealGate":"Tess shares a working copy after a specific research conversation; it establishes a possible route, not an approved design.","portable":false,"automaticLoot":false},{"id":"7d302e54-1187-570c-b301-7d28b4b3a182","slug":"early-stake-print","title":"Clara’s earlier survey photograph","holderCharacterId":"227c6912-aa1c-56e7-ac17-06e97a40ffab","originLocationId":"612b4cfc-93a0-569b-b03e-7db79372c573","revealGate":"Clara releases a print and dates it using her appointment book; the image shows a survey marker, not anyone’s intent.","portable":false,"automaticLoot":false},{"id":"893c933d-8630-5338-8039-c7cb567d5726","slug":"investor-limit-letter","title":"Victor’s authorization limit","holderCharacterId":"77ae229b-0456-55e9-bf5a-6358ef347bcc","originLocationId":"ec896c98-a5c1-5cdc-b6e9-96cdefc12925","revealGate":"Victor discloses the limit during negotiation, or an authorized filed reply establishes it; his private desk is not a public clue source.","portable":false,"automaticLoot":false}],"stages":[{"index":1,"title":"A promise on paper","scene":"Compare what the public proposal actually promises with what Tess can establish and the workers have observed.","entryState":"unstarted","exitState":"the-other-bank.stage_1_complete","transitionRule":"A saved authored decision records what happened. An LLM suggestion is not the transition itself."},{"index":2,"title":"A storm at the works","scene":"A sudden rise interrupts the shift. An authored scene lets Tom help colleagues withdraw while Tess records the interruption; this creates a delay, not an engineering verdict.","entryState":"the-other-bank.stage_1_complete","exitState":"the-other-bank.stage_2_complete","transitionRule":"A saved authored decision records what happened. An LLM suggestion is not the transition itself."},{"index":3,"title":"The price of the crossing","scene":"At a properly convened hearing, choose which supported proposal to advocate and whether to expose a misleading claim. The council’s response is a saved story outcome.","entryState":"the-other-bank.stage_2_complete","exitState":"the-other-bank.stage_3_complete","transitionRule":"A saved authored decision records what happened. An LLM suggestion is not the transition itself."}],"endings":[{"key":"conditional-build","title":"Conditional Build","consequences":"Support construction with revised access terms and review milestones. The railway may accept narrower profits; approval does not instantly finish the bridge.","exclusiveOutcomeGroup":"the-other-bank.resolution"},{"key":"seek-alternative","title":"Seek Alternative","consequences":"Fund and authorize further assessment of Tess’s route. The delay costs wages and rent while leaving a less restrictive future possible.","exclusiveOutcomeGroup":"the-other-bank.resolution"},{"key":"withhold-support","title":"Withhold Support","consequences":"Decline to support the present franchise and help affected households through the delay. Victor remains a person with arguments, rather than vanishing as a defeated villain.","exclusiveOutcomeGroup":"the-other-bank.resolution"}],"relationshipThread":"A relationship with Tess, Victor, or a worker is tested by whether disagreement can coexist with affection. No partner must adopt the player’s civic position.","declineOption":"The player can decline or pause. Characters retain their lives and disagreements; no automatic romance loss or unchosen crime follows.","knowledgeRule":"Reveal only a clue actually disclosed or established in this saved playthrough. Unchosen endings are authoring alternatives, not simultaneous canon.","persistenceRule":"Resolution and subsequent schedule/location changes are saved. Resolved clues do not replay as fresh revelations at weekly events."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"arc:the-borrowed-horse","content_type":"story_arc","knowledge_scope":"story","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"2a4d447f-e779-566c-a26d-e94966409d93","slug":"the-borrowed-horse","title":"The Borrowed Horse","characterIds":["db699624-91b3-5c34-93ec-53c7974498fb","b118391c-c144-5e58-9bda-6ccc7a100d38","dd646eaf-8983-567b-b3c5-00d4f5175b2c","55a8bac4-eb22-50e5-ae50-84704e68caab","07d26fd4-4d0a-5846-8553-91c92a1a8073"],"locationIds":["602be10b-b09b-58df-965e-033a1ea401d8","a3ac9f2f-33ff-5d19-af2a-cd83828e586d","96ed8d24-eb88-5fa9-ae9c-45257c6c6221","5bd7111c-2e34-5c40-9779-b4dd2aec21c3","24b62a9d-2605-5f9b-985d-816d3bc5da91"],"openingHook":"At the livery rail, a tired traveler calls a boarded mare by a name June has never heard. The animal turns before anybody answers.","stakes":"June’s business rests on trust; Kit needs transport for her claim; the person asserting ownership may also be mistaken. A quick public accusation would travel farther than a later correction.","clues":[{"id":"231cf821-47c0-5a09-a6c0-502c78e85131","slug":"boarding-note","title":"June’s boarding note","holderCharacterId":"db699624-91b3-5c34-93ec-53c7974498fb","originLocationId":"602be10b-b09b-58df-965e-033a1ea401d8","revealGate":"June shares the terms with the parties to the dispute.","portable":false,"automaticLoot":false},{"id":"55cc6ec4-4356-52ff-bcdc-95275fd152a8","slug":"repair-mark","title":"Gabriel’s dated tack repair record","holderCharacterId":"55a8bac4-eb22-50e5-ae50-84704e68caab","originLocationId":"5bd7111c-2e34-5c40-9779-b4dd2aec21c3","revealGate":"Gabriel confirms the work and customer with permission; a repaired item can change hands.","portable":false,"automaticLoot":false},{"id":"460eff6e-1c87-58c2-a44a-bab33a483d77","slug":"relay-receipt","title":"Eve’s delivery receipt","holderCharacterId":"dd646eaf-8983-567b-b3c5-00d4f5175b2c","originLocationId":"96ed8d24-eb88-5fa9-ae9c-45257c6c6221","revealGate":"Eve provides the relevant portion after the sender authorizes it or a story hearing orders it.","portable":false,"automaticLoot":false}],"stages":[{"index":1,"title":"Two names","scene":"Hear the conflicting accounts separately and keep the animal’s immediate care distinct from the ownership argument.","entryState":"unstarted","exitState":"the-borrowed-horse.stage_1_complete","transitionRule":"A saved authored decision records what happened. An LLM suggestion is not the transition itself."},{"index":2,"title":"A road interrupted","scene":"An afternoon storm strands the parties at the coach station. The confined wait gives them time to admit what their paperwork leaves out.","entryState":"the-borrowed-horse.stage_1_complete","exitState":"the-borrowed-horse.stage_2_complete","transitionRule":"A saved authored decision records what happened. An LLM suggestion is not the transition itself."},{"index":3,"title":"A name in the ledger","scene":"Compare the supported sequence of loans and sales, then seek an agreed return, documented purchase, or formal claim.","entryState":"the-borrowed-horse.stage_2_complete","exitState":"the-borrowed-horse.stage_3_complete","transitionRule":"A saved authored decision records what happened. An LLM suggestion is not the transition itself."}],"endings":[{"key":"agreed-return","title":"Agreed Return","consequences":"The mare returns to the established owner and June arranges a different hire for the person who relied on the disputed loan.","exclusiveOutcomeGroup":"the-borrowed-horse.resolution"},{"key":"documented-sale","title":"Documented Sale","consequences":"The parties agree a new sale on explicit terms; a practical compromise does not rewrite the earlier mistake.","exclusiveOutcomeGroup":"the-borrowed-horse.resolution"},{"key":"formal-dispute","title":"Formal Dispute","consequences":"The claim remains contested and proceeds through an authored hearing. The player can stop participating without the horse disappearing into inventory.","exclusiveOutcomeGroup":"the-borrowed-horse.resolution"}],"relationshipThread":"Shared care, a rain-delayed conversation, and an offered ride create room for attraction without making an animal or transport a romantic reward.","declineOption":"The player can decline or pause. Characters retain their lives and disagreements; no automatic romance loss or unchosen crime follows.","knowledgeRule":"Reveal only a clue actually disclosed or established in this saved playthrough. Unchosen endings are authoring alternatives, not simultaneous canon.","persistenceRule":"Resolution and subsequent schedule/location changes are saved. Resolved clues do not replay as fresh revelations at weekly events."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"arc:the-last-encore","content_type":"story_arc","knowledge_scope":"story","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"eabfaee1-1df0-54ec-9183-b31adaaafea9","slug":"the-last-encore","title":"The Last Encore","characterIds":["ab4cfd68-d04d-5ebb-b874-e33648cca0c3","9ed7daa2-a0a3-52cf-b7f4-ad8d220750ab","c08888b0-bc02-502f-a0ac-eacfef8b5388","413d9066-13cf-5dcc-acb7-6dcf0c8d506c","48948de7-27bd-5a3c-8053-3afa6e59f55d"],"locationIds":["7e80c107-194e-5283-9f41-8964f282e145","e0526a03-fbb9-5eb9-bdbd-31872d63f11b","83833b22-7a11-59ac-b4ee-27cea0e3c35b","38b0efd4-b1d9-5b32-bc1f-b0b711da47ca"],"openingHook":"Rosalie’s rehearsal ends with an unfamiliar man’s letter on the piano and a final note nobody seems ready to stop hearing.","stakes":"A touring engagement could advance Rosalie’s career and leave friends with an empty stage, changed income, and feelings they have mistaken for a claim on her future.","clues":[{"id":"0dc9acf7-b3da-5d40-a50a-18a58d4bc800","slug":"tour-offer","title":"Rosalie’s conditional touring offer","holderCharacterId":"ab4cfd68-d04d-5ebb-b874-e33648cca0c3","originLocationId":"7e80c107-194e-5283-9f41-8964f282e145","revealGate":"She chooses to discuss its actual terms after the invitation becomes relevant.","portable":true,"automaticLoot":false},{"id":"2c250bb4-5a05-5de6-b390-b39a52faae29","slug":"advance-bookings","title":"Gin’s released booking commitments","holderCharacterId":"9ed7daa2-a0a3-52cf-b7f4-ad8d220750ab","originLocationId":"e0526a03-fbb9-5eb9-bdbd-31872d63f11b","revealGate":"Gin shares the public commitments affected by a departure; her entire account book remains private.","portable":false,"automaticLoot":false},{"id":"b5b1ca5e-d71e-5245-9d34-25caa987fac3","slug":"new-bill","title":"Cora and Bess’s proposed local program","holderCharacterId":"c08888b0-bc02-502f-a0ac-eacfef8b5388","originLocationId":"83833b22-7a11-59ac-b4ee-27cea0e3c35b","revealGate":"A rehearsal invitation reveals an alternative evening bill, not a plan to replace Rosalie without consultation.","portable":false,"automaticLoot":false}],"stages":[{"index":1,"title":"An audience of friends","scene":"Attend the rehearsal, ask what Rosalie wants, and discover who has already begun making plans on her behalf.","entryState":"unstarted","exitState":"the-last-encore.stage_1_complete","transitionRule":"A saved authored decision records what happened. An LLM suggestion is not the transition itself."},{"index":2,"title":"The wrong toast","scene":"At a crowded supper, Felix says something familiar enough to sound like a promise. Rosalie decides whether to correct him privately or publicly.","entryState":"the-last-encore.stage_1_complete","exitState":"the-last-encore.stage_2_complete","transitionRule":"A saved authored decision records what happened. An LLM suggestion is not the transition itself."},{"index":3,"title":"An encore freely given","scene":"Help arrange a farewell, negotiate a shorter engagement, or build a stronger local program without sabotaging the offer.","entryState":"the-last-encore.stage_2_complete","exitState":"the-last-encore.stage_3_complete","transitionRule":"A saved authored decision records what happened. An LLM suggestion is not the transition itself."}],"endings":[{"key":"take-the-road","title":"Take The Road","consequences":"Rosalie chooses the tour. Saved correspondence and a planned return sustain her relationship; she is not silently removed from an active route.","exclusiveOutcomeGroup":"the-last-encore.resolution","transition":{"kind":"absence","characterId":"ab4cfd68-d04d-5ebb-b874-e33648cca0c3"}},{"key":"short-engagement","title":"Short Engagement","consequences":"She negotiates a limited engagement if the offer supports it, leaving both local and traveling work possible.","exclusiveOutcomeGroup":"the-last-encore.resolution","transition":{"kind":"absence","characterId":"ab4cfd68-d04d-5ebb-b874-e33648cca0c3"}},{"key":"stay-by-choice","title":"Stay By Choice","consequences":"She stays for a credible artistic and financial opportunity she helped design. Staying is not proof that a lover won.","exclusiveOutcomeGroup":"the-last-encore.resolution"}],"relationshipThread":"Goodbye, ambition, a former intimacy with Felix, and new attraction can coexist. The player may offer a future without making it the price of love.","declineOption":"The player can decline or pause. Characters retain their lives and disagreements; no automatic romance loss or unchosen crime follows.","knowledgeRule":"Reveal only a clue actually disclosed or established in this saved playthrough. Unchosen endings are authoring alternatives, not simultaneous canon.","persistenceRule":"Resolution and subsequent schedule/location changes are saved. Resolved clues do not replay as fresh revelations at weekly events."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"arc:water-after-dark","content_type":"story_arc","knowledge_scope":"story","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"2b6c0e6e-b27a-52e4-b64e-079fc2588e5c","slug":"water-after-dark","title":"Water After Dark","characterIds":["fe0749b0-c5c5-5fb0-825c-5faae2bb1360","8d8a8b9e-aac5-5c86-883c-e55d5c1245ba","43961d6e-533a-5c23-8471-fae9af0d437e","1da23f8d-f6c7-5bf5-8da7-e40715399063","788149f7-b7e6-5b4b-9fac-4d04eb4b7b05","96098866-3090-5564-9617-ac35b34cbd35"],"locationIds":["aac1591a-0117-5969-b59e-1f2d6b1b1ab1","66cb94b2-6df9-5c91-86ff-8d1075fa3c11","9b59c945-7e98-535f-bf7e-87f98f50ff89","d62ba68c-1c91-56e2-8cdd-de1b2507f0cb","2af0c3b9-c860-5643-b0bd-c64ae9ece593","52c5ebd4-ec17-505f-972a-733356fdcd43"],"openingHook":"At dawn, two growers find different stories in the same wet channel. One has saved a crop; another has lost the turn she was promised.","stakes":"The old register mixes privilege, genuine labor, and practical accommodation. Catching one diversion will not make the whole arrangement fair or keep every field alive.","clues":[{"id":"651ef7d3-3ccd-5654-9802-abd55cfcdaaf","slug":"late-turn-entry","title":"Mateo’s late emergency entry","holderCharacterId":"fe0749b0-c5c5-5fb0-825c-5faae2bb1360","originLocationId":"aac1591a-0117-5969-b59e-1f2d6b1b1ab1","revealGate":"Mateo admits the late entry when asked about the mismatch; it does not account for all the water.","portable":false,"automaticLoot":false},{"id":"0aea4c7a-6896-5217-9cbe-66e1d45e46d3","slug":"ranch-promise","title":"Adelaide’s prior household promise","holderCharacterId":"8d8a8b9e-aac5-5c86-883c-e55d5c1245ba","originLocationId":"66cb94b2-6df9-5c91-86ff-8d1075fa3c11","revealGate":"Adelaide or the affected household consents to describing the promise.","portable":false,"automaticLoot":false},{"id":"8d762214-e38b-5fe5-8fc0-ff594c80ead6","slug":"growers-log","title":"The growers’ shared observations","holderCharacterId":"43961d6e-533a-5c23-8471-fae9af0d437e","originLocationId":"9b59c945-7e98-535f-bf7e-87f98f50ff89","revealGate":"Inés assembles volunteered observations with dates; local gossip is not silently converted into measurements.","portable":false,"automaticLoot":false}],"stages":[{"index":1,"title":"Wet earth","scene":"Compare authorized records with firsthand accounts and recognize the households facing immediate loss.","entryState":"unstarted","exitState":"water-after-dark.stage_1_complete","transitionRule":"A saved authored decision records what happened. An LLM suggestion is not the transition itself."},{"index":2,"title":"The hot afternoon","scene":"Help organize ordinary deliveries and shade while tempers rise at the market. A dispute between Daisy and Flora reveals different dependence on the same allocation.","entryState":"water-after-dark.stage_1_complete","exitState":"water-after-dark.stage_2_complete","transitionRule":"A saved authored decision records what happened. An LLM suggestion is not the transition itself."},{"index":3,"title":"A turn for tomorrow","scene":"Bring a concrete temporary arrangement and a separate reform proposal to the association. Mateo must account for his own exception.","entryState":"water-after-dark.stage_2_complete","exitState":"water-after-dark.stage_3_complete","transitionRule":"A saved authored decision records what happened. An LLM suggestion is not the transition itself."}],"endings":[{"key":"temporary-pool","title":"Temporary Pool","consequences":"Members voluntarily pool part of the next turns while reviewing the register. It provides relief and leaves the larger argument alive.","exclusiveOutcomeGroup":"water-after-dark.resolution"},{"key":"revised-priority","title":"Revised Priority","consequences":"An authored association vote changes future priority and obligations, creating both gratitude and resentment.","exclusiveOutcomeGroup":"water-after-dark.resolution"},{"key":"record-and-step-back","title":"Record And Step Back","consequences":"Publish only consented or public facts and leave the vote to members. The player can remain a friend without becoming the valley’s permanent mediator.","exclusiveOutcomeGroup":"water-after-dark.resolution"}],"relationshipThread":"A walk with Lena or Mateo can become an evening with no public duty attached; Adelaide’s route asks whether love can survive a loss of control.","declineOption":"The player can decline or pause. Characters retain their lives and disagreements; no automatic romance loss or unchosen crime follows.","knowledgeRule":"Reveal only a clue actually disclosed or established in this saved playthrough. Unchosen endings are authoring alternatives, not simultaneous canon.","persistenceRule":"Resolution and subsequent schedule/location changes are saved. Resolved clues do not replay as fresh revelations at weekly events."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"arc:a-room-kept-warm","content_type":"story_arc","knowledge_scope":"story","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"c4160e37-0afe-5d1c-b22a-5f1fbd9540ac","slug":"a-room-kept-warm","title":"A Room Kept Warm","characterIds":["2a838e0f-f2e8-582a-8925-1380e8f9cc3b","c48b4d60-f01d-50e5-8a74-f5c7977df0b5","b884dee9-b258-5d00-97cd-16a401685fa6","a71259b6-01ca-57c1-b8f6-1f4a2ed5d8d3","8394a4a8-7d5f-5f8f-bbbf-0a21e60b8c90"],"locationIds":["29628d1c-5f41-52d4-bd76-4bb8a82c7a68","7a59bff3-f402-598c-87a7-69a7ab77f6b0","b293826d-7379-5ead-9e36-d0925ae2acb7","6091676c-6511-5aa5-81a4-6582b38dbc30","41f0e160-b457-5611-9cb3-e6d9cbca84e4"],"openingHook":"Agnes sets one extra place at supper and asks the table to talk about anything except the envelope beside her plate.","stakes":"Late wages and an unpaid hotel contract have shifted costs onto people with the smallest reserves. A public rescue could expose residents’ hardship and let the actual debtors escape attention.","clues":[{"id":"9dd3a3d6-cb05-566a-9f2a-7b2179da21ab","slug":"hotel-invoices","title":"Ruth’s unpaid service invoices","holderCharacterId":"c48b4d60-f01d-50e5-8a74-f5c7977df0b5","originLocationId":"7a59bff3-f402-598c-87a7-69a7ab77f6b0","revealGate":"Ruth shares business totals and keeps individual workers’ earnings private.","portable":false,"automaticLoot":false},{"id":"103fd6e6-cb75-5aaa-8858-52e879d5dd48","slug":"pay-delay-log","title":"Ben’s documented wage delays","holderCharacterId":"b884dee9-b258-5d00-97cd-16a401685fa6","originLocationId":"b293826d-7379-5ead-9e36-d0925ae2acb7","revealGate":"The mutual society authorizes a relevant summary.","portable":false,"automaticLoot":false},{"id":"d604b46c-9556-51f5-aa70-222f80f73b2f","slug":"rent-reserve","title":"Agnes’s own reserve account","holderCharacterId":"2a838e0f-f2e8-582a-8925-1380e8f9cc3b","originLocationId":"29628d1c-5f41-52d4-bd76-4bb8a82c7a68","revealGate":"Agnes chooses to discuss the house’s position; residents’ names are omitted unless they consent.","portable":false,"automaticLoot":false}],"stages":[{"index":1,"title":"An ordinary supper","scene":"Help with an ordinary house need and hear the problem without turning the table into a public inquiry.","entryState":"unstarted","exitState":"a-room-kept-warm.stage_1_complete","transitionRule":"A saved authored decision records what happened. An LLM suggestion is not the transition itself."},{"index":2,"title":"Who owes whom","scene":"Trace the actual obligations and distinguish disputed amounts from established debts.","entryState":"a-room-kept-warm.stage_1_complete","exitState":"a-room-kept-warm.stage_2_complete","transitionRule":"A saved authored decision records what happened. An LLM suggestion is not the transition itself."},{"index":3,"title":"Keeping the door open","scene":"Choose a collections effort, voluntary relief arrangement, or a smaller sustainable operating plan with the people affected.","entryState":"a-room-kept-warm.stage_2_complete","exitState":"a-room-kept-warm.stage_3_complete","transitionRule":"A saved authored decision records what happened. An LLM suggestion is not the transition itself."}],"endings":[{"key":"debts-paid","title":"Debts Paid","consequences":"The responsible businesses settle documented obligations through an authored agreement; the house recovers without pretending it received charity.","exclusiveOutcomeGroup":"a-room-kept-warm.resolution"},{"key":"shared-reserve","title":"Shared Reserve","consequences":"A voluntary reserve buys time with clear limits and resident control. It cannot absorb every future failure.","exclusiveOutcomeGroup":"a-room-kept-warm.resolution"},{"key":"smaller-house","title":"Smaller House","consequences":"Agnes reduces commitments and arranges transitions with residents. Survival need not mean sacrificing herself indefinitely.","exclusiveOutcomeGroup":"a-room-kept-warm.resolution"}],"relationshipThread":"Care appears in a meal, an honest limit, or company after a difficult conversation. Paying someone’s bill never buys their confidence or intimacy.","declineOption":"The player can decline or pause. Characters retain their lives and disagreements; no automatic romance loss or unchosen crime follows.","knowledgeRule":"Reveal only a clue actually disclosed or established in this saved playthrough. Unchosen endings are authoring alternatives, not simultaneous canon.","persistenceRule":"Resolution and subsequent schedule/location changes are saved. Resolved clues do not replay as fresh revelations at weekly events."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"arc:the-honest-weight","content_type":"story_arc","knowledge_scope":"story","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"2fc577fd-e07a-57dd-a8d8-80079f59496e","slug":"the-honest-weight","title":"The Honest Weight","characterIds":["cc342d4a-c160-5567-87aa-07506734b1f9","b884dee9-b258-5d00-97cd-16a401685fa6","b118391c-c144-5e58-9bda-6ccc7a100d38","cffa45a6-3817-5f0d-9fde-3ec4ca76696a","82e1ec55-9183-5279-a7f8-1e62d54061b1"],"locationIds":["4c788a8a-77fd-5fd4-8be8-e4b7a1d9aac0","b293826d-7379-5ead-9e36-d0925ae2acb7","a3ac9f2f-33ff-5d19-af2a-cd83828e586d","ab3eb385-e566-5113-93a2-ce83021d5dd4","f7659198-986a-589e-95b0-0f36193fd1cc"],"openingHook":"Two assay slips lie under the same lamp. The figures differ enough to change a life; the labels differ just enough to keep Vera from calling it proof.","stakes":"Kit’s hopes, miners’ pay, and a trading post’s credit depend on trustworthy quantities. A dramatic accusation could destroy a livelihood before anyone establishes which sample was tested.","clues":[{"id":"63c445cf-032d-59fa-8c1d-efb5f7ca9213","slug":"sample-labels","title":"Vera’s compared sample labels","holderCharacterId":"cc342d4a-c160-5567-87aa-07506734b1f9","originLocationId":"4c788a8a-77fd-5fd4-8be8-e4b7a1d9aac0","revealGate":"Vera explains the mismatch to the relevant claimants and releases a copy with permission.","portable":false,"automaticLoot":false},{"id":"e1e0296c-a3c6-516e-a459-0d45a75704f5","slug":"weighing-notes","title":"Ben’s repeated weighing observations","holderCharacterId":"b884dee9-b258-5d00-97cd-16a401685fa6","originLocationId":"b293826d-7379-5ead-9e36-d0925ae2acb7","revealGate":"Ben provides the dated notes and the uncertainty he recorded alongside them.","portable":false,"automaticLoot":false},{"id":"2898120e-f7b3-5e9f-9b2c-688cf4eba562","slug":"sale-descriptions","title":"Isaac’s public sale descriptions","holderCharacterId":"cffa45a6-3817-5f0d-9fde-3ec4ca76696a","originLocationId":"ab3eb385-e566-5113-93a2-ce83021d5dd4","revealGate":"Public catalog descriptions can be compared with permitted observation; this establishes a separate pattern to investigate.","portable":false,"automaticLoot":false}],"stages":[{"index":1,"title":"Glitter and figures","scene":"Hear the hopeful story about the claim, then ask Vera what the material actually supports.","entryState":"unstarted","exitState":"the-honest-weight.stage_1_complete","transitionRule":"A saved authored decision records what happened. An LLM suggestion is not the transition itself."},{"index":2,"title":"A crowded sale","scene":"At the yard, Isaac must decide whether to correct an influential seller in front of potential employers.","entryState":"the-honest-weight.stage_1_complete","exitState":"the-honest-weight.stage_2_complete","transitionRule":"A saved authored decision records what happened. An LLM suggestion is not the transition itself."},{"index":3,"title":"A finding worth keeping","scene":"Arrange a qualified recheck with documented sample handling, then decide what supported result should be made public.","entryState":"the-honest-weight.stage_2_complete","exitState":"the-honest-weight.stage_3_complete","transitionRule":"A saved authored decision records what happened. An LLM suggestion is not the transition itself."}],"endings":[{"key":"corrected-records","title":"Corrected Records","consequences":"A confirmed clerical or handling error is corrected with compensation where agreed; disappointment survives even when fraud does not.","exclusiveOutcomeGroup":"the-honest-weight.resolution"},{"key":"supported-complaint","title":"Supported Complaint","consequences":"Evidence supports a specific complaint, leading to an authored investigation and contested consequences.","exclusiveOutcomeGroup":"the-honest-weight.resolution"},{"key":"uncertain-claim","title":"Uncertain Claim","consequences":"The evidence remains insufficient. Kit must decide how much time and money to risk, and the player can support a choice without guaranteeing a strike.","exclusiveOutcomeGroup":"the-honest-weight.resolution"}],"relationshipThread":"Vera values patient attention; Kit resists being treated as a foolish dreamer; Ben wants a companion who can enjoy an evening beyond the grievance book.","declineOption":"The player can decline or pause. Characters retain their lives and disagreements; no automatic romance loss or unchosen crime follows.","knowledgeRule":"Reveal only a clue actually disclosed or established in this saved playthrough. Unchosen endings are authoring alternatives, not simultaneous canon.","persistenceRule":"Resolution and subsequent schedule/location changes are saved. Resolved clues do not replay as fresh revelations at weekly events."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"arc:the-price-of-news","content_type":"story_arc","knowledge_scope":"story","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"38a4caeb-6158-56c4-90b2-6678b0ad75be","slug":"the-price-of-news","title":"The Price of News","characterIds":["63a4bf14-598c-509f-861f-46a1ce3c729b","17799880-e679-5080-b921-b9f4afa3b6fb","39ed7112-d367-5790-a841-f76c9eab8052","227c6912-aa1c-56e7-ac17-06e97a40ffab","77ae229b-0456-55e9-bf5a-6358ef347bcc"],"locationIds":["b8e6063d-69c1-5791-bb0d-595e8ea26148","12a6914f-0fe4-544d-bfe9-b36c97ea81e8","271261e4-6280-5c1d-be25-dbbdab07ccf9","612b4cfc-93a0-569b-b03e-7db79372c573","ec896c98-a5c1-5cdc-b6e9-96cdefc12925"],"openingHook":"Just before the press starts, Iris receives a accusation neat enough to print and incomplete enough to ruin somebody unfairly.","stakes":"The town needs a record it can trust. Iris also needs to pay for paper, wages, and the machine that makes independence possible.","clues":[{"id":"9300c8d1-c6ca-518d-99e9-a6a2f59b444f","slug":"offered-advance","title":"Iris’s conditional financing offer","holderCharacterId":"63a4bf14-598c-509f-861f-46a1ce3c729b","originLocationId":"b8e6063d-69c1-5791-bb0d-595e8ea26148","revealGate":"Iris voluntarily discusses the proposal; it is evidence of an offer, not that she accepted it.","portable":false,"automaticLoot":false},{"id":"ef5a3afc-a125-5c00-989f-ad8f55336f2d","slug":"filed-notice-dates","title":"Esther’s public notice chronology","holderCharacterId":"17799880-e679-5080-b921-b9f4afa3b6fb","originLocationId":"12a6914f-0fe4-544d-bfe9-b36c97ea81e8","revealGate":"Obtain ordinary public copies and preserve their dates.","portable":false,"automaticLoot":false},{"id":"55ed8c15-d953-5203-add7-00ab2ee4235f","slug":"message-timing","title":"An authorized message-timing confirmation","holderCharacterId":"39ed7112-d367-5790-a841-f76c9eab8052","originLocationId":"271261e4-6280-5c1d-be25-dbbdab07ccf9","revealGate":"The sender permits Daniel to confirm a relevant dispatch time; message content remains separately protected.","portable":false,"automaticLoot":false}],"stages":[{"index":1,"title":"Before the ink","scene":"Help separate a checkable allegation from inference and decide whether a correction can wait until the next edition.","entryState":"unstarted","exitState":"the-price-of-news.stage_1_complete","transitionRule":"A saved authored decision records what happened. An LLM suggestion is not the transition itself."},{"index":2,"title":"The easy money","scene":"A patron makes financing sound like friendship. Iris must state what access she will and will not sell.","entryState":"the-price-of-news.stage_1_complete","exitState":"the-price-of-news.stage_2_complete","transitionRule":"A saved authored decision records what happened. An LLM suggestion is not the transition itself."},{"index":3,"title":"What goes to press","scene":"Prepare a sourced account, a limited correction, or a clear notice that the inquiry is unfinished. Iris retains the editorial decision.","entryState":"the-price-of-news.stage_2_complete","exitState":"the-price-of-news.stage_3_complete","transitionRule":"A saved authored decision records what happened. An LLM suggestion is not the transition itself."}],"endings":[{"key":"publish-supported","title":"Publish Supported","consequences":"The paper prints substantiated findings and faces the resulting social and commercial pressure.","exclusiveOutcomeGroup":"the-price-of-news.resolution"},{"key":"print-limited","title":"Print Limited","consequences":"A narrow correction avoids overclaiming and disappoints people who wanted a sweeping accusation.","exclusiveOutcomeGroup":"the-price-of-news.resolution"},{"key":"hold-and-finance","title":"Hold And Finance","consequences":"Publication waits for evidence while Iris seeks less controlling finance; the delay is visible and open to criticism.","exclusiveOutcomeGroup":"the-price-of-news.resolution"}],"relationshipThread":"For Iris, Daniel, Esther, or Clara, trust includes the right to keep a confidence and the courage to correct a person they like.","declineOption":"The player can decline or pause. Characters retain their lives and disagreements; no automatic romance loss or unchosen crime follows.","knowledgeRule":"Reveal only a clue actually disclosed or established in this saved playthrough. Unchosen endings are authoring alternatives, not simultaneous canon.","persistenceRule":"Resolution and subsequent schedule/location changes are saved. Resolved clues do not replay as fresh revelations at weekly events."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"arc:a-door-of-her-own","content_type":"story_arc","knowledge_scope":"story","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"e7313113-c25a-5427-b29c-d00fa2ff0b6a","slug":"a-door-of-her-own","title":"A Door of Her Own","characterIds":["dbc7cf13-72ae-587a-b3d1-468ca2f132b1","8d8a8b9e-aac5-5c86-883c-e55d5c1245ba","38c61131-14a4-5a14-9165-d307095419ba","dcd714c0-b3e9-5baf-9741-576729534661","55a8bac4-eb22-50e5-ae50-84704e68caab"],"locationIds":["0a1153f9-4db7-541b-99df-1c12023d649f","66cb94b2-6df9-5c91-86ff-8d1075fa3c11","3c7e94d9-4f78-56e4-bc3c-d40056fbfb49","48020030-a545-5efc-b58c-b4c10a96af3f","5bd7111c-2e34-5c40-9779-b4dd2aec21c3"],"openingHook":"Hazel has chosen the paint for her sign before asking Adelaide to read the loan agreement that would put the building partly under her mother’s control.","stakes":"A young business can need help and still deserve autonomy. Adelaide’s money could make the opening possible or extend a family argument into every future decision.","clues":[{"id":"74ffdd9f-34c9-5d60-8ffa-8695ad2df9d5","slug":"loan-draft","title":"Hazel’s proposed family loan","holderCharacterId":"dbc7cf13-72ae-587a-b3d1-468ca2f132b1","originLocationId":"0a1153f9-4db7-541b-99df-1c12023d649f","revealGate":"Hazel shares the draft as a borrower; the terms remain unagreed.","portable":false,"automaticLoot":false},{"id":"fcdfc429-d71a-563d-b863-82d73836e880","slug":"supply-budget","title":"Lottie’s catalog-based supply comparison","holderCharacterId":"38c61131-14a4-5a14-9165-d307095419ba","originLocationId":"3c7e94d9-4f78-56e4-bc3c-d40056fbfb49","revealGate":"Lottie volunteers her own research, with no access to her employer’s private accounts.","portable":false,"automaticLoot":false},{"id":"0b157c86-6bdb-5a6f-a0bd-48fff2eeb112","slug":"demand-log","title":"Nate’s released station demand summary","holderCharacterId":"dcd714c0-b3e9-5baf-9741-576729534661","originLocationId":"48020030-a545-5efc-b58c-b4c10a96af3f","revealGate":"The station permits a non-personal summary of demand; passenger identities are irrelevant.","portable":false,"automaticLoot":false}],"stages":[{"index":1,"title":"Paint and promises","scene":"Help Hazel describe what she wants the business to become before everyone argues over how to fund it.","entryState":"unstarted","exitState":"a-door-of-her-own.stage_1_complete","transitionRule":"A saved authored decision records what happened. An LLM suggestion is not the transition itself."},{"index":2,"title":"The family supper","scene":"Adelaide offers protection in the language of experience. Hazel must answer the actual terms rather than only the history between them.","entryState":"a-door-of-her-own.stage_1_complete","exitState":"a-door-of-her-own.stage_2_complete","transitionRule":"A saved authored decision records what happened. An LLM suggestion is not the transition itself."},{"index":3,"title":"Opening the door","scene":"Compare a smaller independent launch, a bounded family loan, or a partnership whose rights are explicit.","entryState":"a-door-of-her-own.stage_2_complete","exitState":"a-door-of-her-own.stage_3_complete","transitionRule":"A saved authored decision records what happened. An LLM suggestion is not the transition itself."}],"endings":[{"key":"small-and-owned","title":"Small And Owned","consequences":"Hazel opens at a smaller scale with narrower inventory and retains decision authority.","exclusiveOutcomeGroup":"a-door-of-her-own.resolution"},{"key":"bounded-loan","title":"Bounded Loan","consequences":"Mother and daughter agree a documented loan with limited controls and an achievable repayment plan.","exclusiveOutcomeGroup":"a-door-of-her-own.resolution"},{"key":"shared-venture","title":"Shared Venture","consequences":"A genuine partnership opens sooner and requires continuing shared decisions; Hazel does not magically retain sole control.","exclusiveOutcomeGroup":"a-door-of-her-own.resolution"}],"relationshipThread":"Hazel’s attraction is adult and self-directed. Adelaide’s romance route can explore a life beyond managing her daughter’s future.","declineOption":"The player can decline or pause. Characters retain their lives and disagreements; no automatic romance loss or unchosen crime follows.","knowledgeRule":"Reveal only a clue actually disclosed or established in this saved playthrough. Unchosen endings are authoring alternatives, not simultaneous canon.","persistenceRule":"Resolution and subsequent schedule/location changes are saved. Resolved clues do not replay as fresh revelations at weekly events."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"arc:closing-time","content_type":"story_arc","knowledge_scope":"story","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"8e86f6c1-198e-5755-a082-901b802c76ce","slug":"closing-time","title":"Closing Time","characterIds":["78bb861c-ec4e-5acb-9a14-211d669a33c6","9ed7daa2-a0a3-52cf-b7f4-ad8d220750ab","2aedb376-b459-54f7-ae2e-4a2251f295c7","65bf20fb-85f1-51f2-8b4a-cfe7cee517ef","aa9e4ede-81e0-5b52-a1cc-90e086016028","413d9066-13cf-5dcc-acb7-6dcf0c8d506c"],"locationIds":["1a511bfe-6c6d-5942-bbae-6f85fa2a7217","e0526a03-fbb9-5eb9-bdbd-31872d63f11b","1382bb5d-2704-5ff2-a0b4-23707e0219e3","15e01963-8be0-5523-b708-90c6ed3f5ad3","fd31aebd-9627-5eb6-aa48-992466e453ee","0ffd252b-6c62-519c-98ab-f2cddf4dd042"],"openingHook":"A closing-time meal begins as a celebration and turns when Alma discovers that the proposed partnership still calls her contribution wages.","stakes":"The evening district sells freedom from ordinary work to customers while its workers negotiate wages, repairs, ownership, and the right to leave.","clues":[{"id":"1b15ce75-acdf-5f6c-a093-ef146c9c176b","slug":"kitchen-draft","title":"Alma’s proposed partnership terms","holderCharacterId":"78bb861c-ec4e-5acb-9a14-211d669a33c6","originLocationId":"1a511bfe-6c6d-5942-bbae-6f85fa2a7217","revealGate":"Alma shares the draft she has been asked to accept.","portable":false,"automaticLoot":false},{"id":"8bbe5521-61e7-5167-9611-12145c726c95","slug":"bath-repairs","title":"Edith’s corrected maintenance account","holderCharacterId":"2aedb376-b459-54f7-ae2e-4a2251f295c7","originLocationId":"1382bb5d-2704-5ff2-a0b4-23707e0219e3","revealGate":"Edith admits the diversion and supplies a corrected account to the people entitled to see it.","portable":false,"automaticLoot":false},{"id":"3772000b-280b-50d0-9904-eb91e6b3177b","slug":"salon-guarantee","title":"Pearl’s conditional guarantee offer","holderCharacterId":"aa9e4ede-81e0-5b52-a1cc-90e086016028","originLocationId":"fd31aebd-9627-5eb6-aa48-992466e453ee","revealGate":"Pearl chooses to discuss the offer after recognizing its personal expectation.","portable":false,"automaticLoot":false}],"stages":[{"index":1,"title":"The last plate","scene":"Listen to a disagreement among friends who have all worked too long to phrase it graciously.","entryState":"unstarted","exitState":"closing-time.stage_1_complete","transitionRule":"A saved authored decision records what happened. An LLM suggestion is not the transition itself."},{"index":2,"title":"What friendship costs","scene":"Compare the three bargains without assuming one district-wide solution fits every business.","entryState":"closing-time.stage_1_complete","exitState":"closing-time.stage_2_complete","transitionRule":"A saved authored decision records what happened. An LLM suggestion is not the transition itself."},{"index":3,"title":"Terms in daylight","scene":"Support specific negotiations: an ownership share, a repair repayment plan, or finance without a patron’s claim on private affection.","entryState":"closing-time.stage_2_complete","exitState":"closing-time.stage_3_complete","transitionRule":"A saved authored decision records what happened. An LLM suggestion is not the transition itself."}],"endings":[{"key":"fairer-terms","title":"Fairer Terms","consequences":"The businesses accept separate revised agreements, strengthening cooperation while preserving disagreements.","exclusiveOutcomeGroup":"closing-time.resolution"},{"key":"independent-route","title":"Independent Route","consequences":"One or more workers choose a smaller independent enterprise and strain a friendship without ending it automatically.","exclusiveOutcomeGroup":"closing-time.resolution"},{"key":"honest-limit","title":"Honest Limit","consequences":"A proposed venture proves unaffordable. People keep their savings and face a less glamorous but sustainable next season.","exclusiveOutcomeGroup":"closing-time.resolution"}],"relationshipThread":"Gin, Alma, Edith, Mabel, Pearl, and Felix each distinguish being enjoyed from being known. An unhurried meal can matter more than a grand gesture.","declineOption":"The player can decline or pause. Characters retain their lives and disagreements; no automatic romance loss or unchosen crime follows.","knowledgeRule":"Reveal only a clue actually disclosed or established in this saved playthrough. Unchosen endings are authoring alternatives, not simultaneous canon.","persistenceRule":"Resolution and subsequent schedule/location changes are saved. Resolved clues do not replay as fresh revelations at weekly events."},"metadata":{"source":"calders_run_authoring_v1","authoringSchema":"calders-run-authoring-pack-v1"}},{"world_id":"31740169-035e-5b10-8c9d-98b206e9f24b","content_key":"arc:the-letter-to-leave","content_type":"story_arc","knowledge_scope":"story","content_level":"standard","payload":{"id":"6091a8cc-6897-500d-a8a7-43e3c9c28381","slug":"the-letter-to-leave","title":"The Letter to Leave","characterIds":["fa092c09-c4c0-5ca4-8482-1c00cc7e5897","0545674e-2ac8-540c-a0b2-ac6882fc4641","de185ba5-cd6b-5022-80cd-8669cc8cfaf2","be0f7849-8182-5ee7-bb81-03aa9c1ec5e9","8394a4a8-7d5f-5f8f-bbbf-0a21e60b8c90"],"locationIds":["65aa25c9-b4db-5710-8594-91642bddc294","afdf3e0c-ab03-519c-b289-7535b91be390","dba2f892-1aef-540f-a8b5-7e443589774b","5a7e186e-f4de-58d9-bbc5-861f9eeeecfd","41f0e160-b457-5611-9cb3-e6d9cbca84e4"],"openingHook":"Eliza receives an education prospectus on the same afternoon someone calls the schoolhouse lucky to have a woman who will surely always remain.","stakes":"Learning and ambition do not end when a community finds someone useful. Nell and August also need room to become more than the roles other adults currently see.","clues":[{"id":"abe1f0d3-f84c-50fe-8760-fef292426ef6","slug":"study-prospectus","title":"Eliza’s study opportunity","holderCharacterId":"fa092c09-c4c0-5ca4-8482-1c00cc7e5897","originLocationId":"65aa25c9-b4db-5710-8594-91642bddc294","revealGate":"Eliza chooses to show the prospectus and application requirements.","portable":false,"automaticLoot":false},{"id":"6826af71-b316-58fe-9242-4213e3e9f9c4","slug":"training-letter","title":"Nell’s proposed training reference","holderCharacterId":"0545674e-2ac8-540c-a0b2-ac6882fc4641","originLocationId":"afdf3e0c-ab03-519c-b289-7535b91be390","revealGate":"Nell asks Lucía to discuss a reference after addressing her work mistake.","portable":false,"automaticLoot":false},{"id":"74cbdc8b-3598-5578-be3f-348a61efe083","slug":"register-duplicate","title":"August’s duplicate burial entry","holderCharacterId":"de185ba5-cd6b-5022-80cd-8669cc8cfaf2","originLocationId":"dba2f892-1aef-540f-a8b5-7e443589774b","revealGate":"Public access or authorized family permission permits comparison; a duplicate is not evidence of a hidden death.","portable":false,"automaticLoot":false}],"stages":[{"index":1,"title":"Useful people","scene":"Attend an adult evening lesson and hear how an ordinary aspiration becomes difficult to admit.","entryState":"unstarted","exitState":"the-letter-to-leave.stage_1_complete","transitionRule":"A saved authored decision records what happened. An LLM suggestion is not the transition itself."},{"index":2,"title":"A mistake named","scene":"Nell corrects an invoice error; August brings forward the duplicate record; neither small uncertainty becomes a sensational conspiracy.","entryState":"the-letter-to-leave.stage_1_complete","exitState":"the-letter-to-leave.stage_2_complete","transitionRule":"A saved authored decision records what happened. An LLM suggestion is not the transition itself."},{"index":3,"title":"A future with an address","scene":"Help plan study, improved local training, or a delayed application with real milestones and room for personal choice.","entryState":"the-letter-to-leave.stage_2_complete","exitState":"the-letter-to-leave.stage_3_complete","transitionRule":"A saved authored decision records what happened. An LLM suggestion is not the transition itself."}],"endings":[{"key":"go-and-return","title":"Go And Return","consequences":"A study absence begins with a saved correspondence plan and an authored return state.","exclusiveOutcomeGroup":"the-letter-to-leave.resolution","transition":{"kind":"absence","characterId":"fa092c09-c4c0-5ca4-8482-1c00cc7e5897"}},{"key":"learn-here","title":"Learn Here","consequences":"Local mentors commit to a credible training arrangement with boundaries on free labor.","exclusiveOutcomeGroup":"the-letter-to-leave.resolution"},{"key":"prepare-next-term","title":"Prepare Next Term","consequences":"The candidate postpones with a dated preparation plan. Delay remains a choice that can later be reconsidered.","exclusiveOutcomeGroup":"the-letter-to-leave.resolution"}],"relationshipThread":"The gentler routes offer letters, walks, shared reading, and affection expressed without haste or an expectation to give up ambition.","declineOption":"The player can decline or pause. Characters retain 